# Never build these into the image.
#
# NOTE: Docker does not support trailing comments here. A line like `data  # the database` is read as a
# pattern named "data  # the database" and matches nothing — so every comment below sits on its own line.
.git
.gitignore
node_modules

# The live database, key, uploads and backups. These belong on a VOLUME, never in a layer.
data

*.log
server.log

.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# 143 findings including exploit repros — must not ship inside a container either.
audit-2026-09-05.csv

# The theme audio and hero video are kept out of GIT (.gitignore) for rights reasons but are deliberately NOT
# excluded here: the image is built from the operator's own working copy where they exist, and the site serves
# them from public/ — excluding them shipped a 404 behind "The Full Send" and the music widget. A fresh clone
# has neither file and builds a working image without them.

# Whitepaper PDFs are built artefacts, not served by the app.
JustSendIt-Whitepaper.pdf
WHITEPAPER.pdf

.DS_Store
